{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33946","headline":"奉和鲁望春雨即事次韵 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望春雨即事次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"织恨凝愁映鸟飞，半旬飘洒掩韶晖。\n山容洗得如烟瘦，地脉流来似乳肥。\n野客正闲移竹远，幽人多病探花稀。\n何年细湿华阳道，两乘巾车相并归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}